{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53778","headline":"赠鸟窠和尚诗（题拟） · 白居易","name":"赠鸟窠和尚诗（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"空门有路不知处，头白齿黄犹念经。\n何年饮着声闻酒，迄至如今醉未醒。\n（同前）（按：《全唐诗》卷四五八《戏礼经老僧》与此诗後二句同，前二句全异，未审爲一诗抑爲二诗。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53778.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53778","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}